WEBVTT

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:23.050
Before I knew it, I abandoned happiness to survive

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:30.190
Lying to myself, I danced clinging on to illusions

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:36.870
At the edge of my vision when I close my eyes

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:42.840
I was searching for your smile

00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:50.210
With our memories fading

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:57.290
We hold on to our dreams and run  Yeah

00:00:57.620 --> 00:01:04.190
These feelings that I shut away in my heart

00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:11.410
I'll now grasp them again

00:01:32.440 --> 00:01:34.910
Yugi, why aren't you attacking?

00:01:34.910 --> 00:01:40.370
You’re playing into Dartz’s hands if you feel bad for your Mirror Knight friends!

00:01:40.840 --> 00:01:48.450
You know that if we lose, your friends nor the world have a future!

00:01:48.450 --> 00:01:52.020
What?  The third Seal of Orichalcos?

00:01:52.020 --> 00:01:54.720
It'll activate its true power?

00:01:56.030 --> 00:02:02.040
The Three Seals of Orichalcos

00:02:06.930 --> 00:02:08.900
Orichalcos Tritos!

00:02:08.900 --> 00:02:13.640
This card will complete The Seal of Orichalcos!

00:02:20.850 --> 00:02:23.870
The third Seal of Orichalcos...

00:02:24.530 --> 00:02:30.720
Orichalcos Deuteros's effect restores my life points!

00:02:32.780 --> 00:02:35.070
Dartz regained life points again!

00:02:35.470 --> 00:02:39.680
Orichalcos Malevolence activates its effect!

00:02:43.620 --> 00:02:51.330
Orichalcos Malevolence’s effect switches your monster from defense to attack position.

00:02:51.330 --> 00:02:52.460
What?

00:02:52.460 --> 00:02:53.480
Kaiba!

00:02:53.820 --> 00:02:56.600
Orichalcos Malevolence attacks!

00:02:57.550 --> 00:02:59.760
If Kaiba takes this attack...

00:02:59.760 --> 00:03:01.730
…his life points will...

00:03:02.020 --> 00:03:05.260
I activate my spell card, Shrink!

00:03:10.530 --> 00:03:17.250
Orichalcos Tritos negates spell and trap cards used against my monsters.

00:03:17.650 --> 00:03:22.090
Seto, your silly tricks won't work on me anymore.

00:03:22.430 --> 00:03:30.450
He raised his monsters’ attack points, recovered his life points, and negated spell and trap cards.

00:03:30.450 --> 00:03:32.610
It’s an impregnable defense!

00:03:32.610 --> 00:03:34.300
Farewell, Seto.

00:03:34.300 --> 00:03:36.460
Orichalcos Malevolence!

00:03:36.460 --> 00:03:38.280
Element Of Crime!

00:03:40.680 --> 00:03:41.680
Big brother!

00:03:41.680 --> 00:03:44.840
I activate my trap, Ambush Shield!

00:03:46.010 --> 00:03:48.770
I tribute Big Shield Gardna!

00:03:50.220 --> 00:03:56.680
I add its 2600 defense points to Different Dimension Dragon’s attack points!

00:03:59.550 --> 00:04:02.270
Different Dimension Dragon's attack points…

00:04:02.270 --> 00:04:04.330
…are now more than his monster's!

00:04:04.330 --> 00:04:08.180
Strike back, Different Dimension Dragon!

00:04:08.180 --> 00:04:10.930
Rainbow Burst!

00:04:23.150 --> 00:04:27.320
Orichalcos Kyutora activates its effect!

00:04:28.370 --> 00:04:34.990
Even if we raise our attack points, he takes no damage as long as he has that monster.

00:04:36.480 --> 00:04:40.780
I see.  You sacrificed your monster to save Seto.

00:04:40.780 --> 00:04:44.320
Is that the power of your bond?

00:04:44.320 --> 00:04:48.070
But Nameless Pharaoh, due to this trap...

00:04:48.070 --> 00:04:52.280
You lost the monster protecting you!

00:04:53.310 --> 00:04:56.700
I'll let you reunite with your friends.

00:04:56.700 --> 00:04:58.330
Mirror Knights!

00:04:58.330 --> 00:05:03.770
Inside the triple Seal of Orichalcos, you can't disobey me.

00:05:03.770 --> 00:05:06.680
Attack Nameless Pharaoh!

00:05:12.520 --> 00:05:13.820
Partner...

00:05:17.390 --> 00:05:18.640
Yugi!

00:05:18.650 --> 00:05:21.570
Keep squirming, Nameless Pharaoh!

00:05:28.580 --> 00:05:29.740
Yugi Boy...

00:05:30.320 --> 00:05:32.680
Can you hear me?

00:05:32.680 --> 00:05:33.840
Pegasus?

00:05:34.360 --> 00:05:38.290
Use the nameless card I gave you.

00:05:38.290 --> 00:05:40.220
Nameless card?

00:05:40.600 --> 00:05:45.900
I created a new card and hid it in this room.

00:05:52.710 --> 00:05:55.470
You mean that card.

00:05:55.930 --> 00:06:01.640
That card holds the power to free the legendary dragons from their seal.

00:06:01.640 --> 00:06:04.660
Free the legendary dragons?

00:06:04.660 --> 00:06:06.510
Mirror Knight Pegasus!

00:06:10.180 --> 00:06:11.620
Yugi!

00:06:13.370 --> 00:06:14.420
Yugi!

00:06:14.820 --> 00:06:17.850
I’m...fine.

00:06:22.740 --> 00:06:26.690
The nameless card that Pegasus mentioned.

00:06:27.020 --> 00:06:30.860
I do have that card in my deck.

00:06:30.860 --> 00:06:36.620
But "free the legendary dragon from their seal?"  What does he mean?

00:06:36.930 --> 00:06:41.050
I set a card and end my turn.

00:06:41.570 --> 00:06:45.300
Seto, draw for the last time!

00:06:46.420 --> 00:06:48.500
He's right.

00:06:48.500 --> 00:06:50.660
I only have 600 life points.

00:06:51.050 --> 00:06:56.140
If I don't do something this turn, I’ll lose.

00:06:57.040 --> 00:07:01.080
I'm going to lose here?

00:07:08.100 --> 00:07:09.780
Amelda...

00:07:11.550 --> 00:07:14.710
You said you would’ve saved your brother.

00:07:14.710 --> 00:07:18.530
But can you really save him?

00:07:18.530 --> 00:07:19.580
I can.

00:07:19.580 --> 00:07:21.380
Then show me.

00:07:22.060 --> 00:07:23.530
I end my turn.

00:07:23.820 --> 00:07:27.680
Amelda, you entrusted me with the future.

00:07:27.680 --> 00:07:31.040
And I have my own road to glory.

00:07:31.040 --> 00:07:35.170
I won't let it be destroyed!

00:07:35.170 --> 00:07:40.770
Open your eyes and see how I duel!

00:07:41.450 --> 00:07:43.320
My turn!  I draw!

00:07:52.380 --> 00:07:54.030
I drew it!

00:07:54.030 --> 00:07:57.460
The card in my deck that will turn this around!

00:07:57.460 --> 00:08:01.500
Come!  The legendary dragon Critias!

00:08:08.180 --> 00:08:09.840
Critias!

00:08:09.840 --> 00:08:18.850
Yugi, if my guess is correct, the set card you can't activate is Mirror Force!

00:08:18.850 --> 00:08:19.790
Kaiba...

00:08:19.790 --> 00:08:22.460
I'll bring out its power!

00:08:22.460 --> 00:08:23.930
Critias!

00:08:23.930 --> 00:08:27.170
Merge with Mirror Force!

00:08:39.090 --> 00:08:40.300
Come out!

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:42.490
Mirror Force Dragon!

00:08:46.840 --> 00:08:48.740
Mirror Force Dragon!

00:08:48.740 --> 00:08:55.130
Yugi, we can't win as long as those Mirror Knights are on the field.

00:08:55.130 --> 00:08:56.360
Kaiba...

00:08:56.360 --> 00:09:02.940
If you can’t sever the bond with your friends, I’ll do it for you!

00:09:02.940 --> 00:09:04.560
Mirror Force Dragon!

00:09:04.560 --> 00:09:07.740
Attack Mirror Knight Pegasus!

00:09:08.570 --> 00:09:10.780
Mirror Burst!

00:09:17.010 --> 00:09:20.270
No good!  Pegasus still has his mirror shield!

00:09:20.270 --> 00:09:24.400
Actually, my brother deliberately chose the one with the shield!

00:09:26.010 --> 00:09:27.320
That’s right!

00:09:27.710 --> 00:09:31.320
I activate Mirror Force Dragon’s effect!

00:09:36.450 --> 00:09:38.770
The reflected energy…

00:09:38.770 --> 00:09:41.700
…is being absorbed by Mirror Force Dragon!

00:09:45.420 --> 00:09:52.930
Mirror Force Dragon’s effect reflects the damage back to all your monsters!

00:09:52.930 --> 00:09:54.080
What?

00:09:54.340 --> 00:09:56.010
So what'll happen to them?

00:09:58.700 --> 00:10:00.880
To your own friends?

00:10:00.880 --> 00:10:06.840
Mokuba and I have thoroughly seen your so-called darkness of the heart.

00:10:07.400 --> 00:10:12.260
To the darkest depths of the heart, even though we didn't want to.

00:10:12.260 --> 00:10:15.720
We overcome it to make it this far!

00:10:15.720 --> 00:10:19.380
My heart has the light to open the future!

00:10:19.380 --> 00:10:21.200
That’s all I need!

00:10:22.720 --> 00:10:23.880
Kaiba...

00:10:23.880 --> 00:10:29.320
If they're true duelists, they wouldn’t mind perishing here.

00:10:30.740 --> 00:10:34.740
Mow them all down, Mirror Force Dragon!

00:10:40.380 --> 00:10:43.060
Genocide Big Bang!

00:10:54.160 --> 00:10:56.420
Partner!  Everyone!

00:10:57.060 --> 00:10:59.840
It's fine.

00:11:02.500 --> 00:11:05.220
Kaiba Boy, thanks.

00:11:09.320 --> 00:11:10.600
Yugi...

00:11:13.500 --> 00:11:15.580
I see, Seto.

00:11:15.580 --> 00:11:18.340
I underestimated you.

00:11:18.340 --> 00:11:26.360
But before Orichalcos Kyutora is destroyed, its effect absorbs the damage I would've taken.

00:11:26.960 --> 00:11:28.560
Everyone…

00:11:28.560 --> 00:11:31.760
All his monsters are now gone.

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:33.720
Are you sure?

00:11:41.060 --> 00:11:46.280
Orichalcos Kyutora, show your true form!

00:11:56.600 --> 00:11:59.540
What is that?

00:12:18.320 --> 00:12:19.600
That's...

00:12:20.020 --> 00:12:23.460
This is Orichalcos Kyutora's evolved form.

00:12:23.460 --> 00:12:25.600
Orichalcos Shunoros!

00:12:26.320 --> 00:12:28.940
Orichalcos Shunoros...

00:12:28.940 --> 00:12:36.000
Its attack points are equal to all the damage Orichalcos Kyutora absorbed.

00:12:36.000 --> 00:12:40.500
So Orichalcos Shunoros's attack points are…

00:12:41.540 --> 00:12:43.240
20,000?

00:12:43.240 --> 00:12:44.480
Unbelievable!

00:12:44.480 --> 00:12:45.920
No way...

00:12:45.920 --> 00:12:48.150
That’s too crazy!

00:12:48.150 --> 00:12:50.260
Why are you surprised?

00:12:50.260 --> 00:12:52.860
You're the ones who raised it!

00:12:53.390 --> 00:12:58.490
Your hatred created Orichalcos Shunoros!

00:12:58.930 --> 00:13:00.920
Our hatred?

00:13:00.920 --> 00:13:06.540
Shunoros loses attack points equal to the points of the monster it fights.

00:13:06.540 --> 00:13:09.880
I activate Orichalcos Shunoros's effect!

00:13:09.880 --> 00:13:10.850
Come out!

00:13:10.850 --> 00:13:13.270
Orichalcos Dexia!

00:13:13.270 --> 00:13:16.080
Orichalcos Aristeros!

00:13:19.010 --> 00:13:25.020
Orichalcos Dexia can't be destroyed as long as Shunoros is on the field.

00:13:25.020 --> 00:13:32.010
It always has 300 more attack points than the monster it's battling.

00:13:32.010 --> 00:13:35.090
It’s Shunoros’s ultimate sword.

00:13:35.360 --> 00:13:41.100
Orichalcos Aristeros can't be destroyed as long as Shunoros is on the field.

00:13:41.100 --> 00:13:45.060
It always has 300 more attack points than yours.

00:13:45.060 --> 00:13:47.100
It stops all attacks.

00:13:47.100 --> 00:13:50.110
It’s Shunoros’s ultimate shield.

00:13:50.410 --> 00:13:56.920
When these two activate, their points are subtracted from Shunoros’s attack points.

00:13:57.370 --> 00:14:00.520
Shunoros is in the back.

00:14:00.520 --> 00:14:04.860
We can't attack it unless we destroy the two in the front first.

00:14:05.240 --> 00:14:07.790
I activate my trap.

00:14:07.790 --> 00:14:09.960
Martyr Curse!

00:14:09.960 --> 00:14:20.840
When my card is destroyed, it seals your monster’s effects and forces it to battle my monster.

00:14:20.840 --> 00:14:26.210
The monster I choose to battle is Mirror Force Dragon!

00:14:27.130 --> 00:14:31.840
Mirror Force Dragon’s effects don't work on Shunoros.

00:14:31.840 --> 00:14:34.620
It's truly over this time, Seto!

00:14:35.220 --> 00:14:37.740
Orichalcos Shunoros attacks!

00:14:46.240 --> 00:14:47.900
Photon Ring!

00:14:59.340 --> 00:15:00.180
Kaiba!

00:15:04.440 --> 00:15:05.640
Big brother!

00:15:14.480 --> 00:15:15.760
Kaiba!

00:15:22.560 --> 00:15:26.650
I activate... my trap...

00:15:32.920 --> 00:15:34.700
Wish of Final Effort.

00:15:34.700 --> 00:15:44.820
When my monster is destroyed, it restores life points equal to its attack points...

00:15:46.070 --> 00:15:47.260
Kaiba!

00:15:47.710 --> 00:15:49.190
Kaiba!

00:15:49.190 --> 00:15:50.520
Big brother!

00:15:51.260 --> 00:15:53.130
Big brother!

00:15:53.450 --> 00:15:54.530
Kaiba!

00:15:54.980 --> 00:15:58.860
Yugi, I paid you back.

00:15:58.860 --> 00:16:01.910
Don't let my corpse stop you.

00:16:03.400 --> 00:16:04.770
Kaiba!

00:16:06.750 --> 00:16:10.410
Seto, you're sacrificed to my god!

00:16:11.750 --> 00:16:13.410
Kaiba!

00:16:28.200 --> 00:16:31.600
A shell with no soul is useless!

00:16:33.430 --> 00:16:34.510
Big brother!

00:16:37.440 --> 00:16:38.530
Kaiba!

00:16:38.530 --> 00:16:39.380
Kaiba!

00:16:39.740 --> 00:16:42.050
Big brother, open your eyes!

00:16:42.660 --> 00:16:44.990
Open your eyes, big brother!

00:16:45.420 --> 00:16:49.660
No matter how loud you scream, Seto can't hear you.

00:16:50.110 --> 00:16:53.080
His soul is no longer there.

00:16:53.500 --> 00:16:58.690
Dammit!  Give my brother’s soul back!

00:17:05.880 --> 00:17:06.900
What?

00:17:34.540 --> 00:17:36.010
Can you hear it?

00:17:36.010 --> 00:17:40.200
My god is happy after receiving Seto’s sacrifice.

00:17:41.360 --> 00:17:45.150
I won't let you sacrifice my brother's soul!

00:17:54.540 --> 00:17:57.280
Anzu!  Mokuba!  Honda!

00:18:09.640 --> 00:18:10.840
Everyone...

00:18:11.390 --> 00:18:15.400
Don’t worry.  Their souls are fine.

00:18:15.400 --> 00:18:20.330
But you have no friends for support anymore.

00:18:20.720 --> 00:18:21.870
Dartz!

00:18:21.870 --> 00:18:29.150
Since it's the end, I'll tell you why I decided to destroy this world.

00:18:29.150 --> 00:18:33.100
It’s because of you, Nameless Pharaoh.

00:18:33.100 --> 00:18:33.900
What?

00:18:34.480 --> 00:18:40.700
Because you decided to return to this world after 3,000 years.

00:18:40.700 --> 00:18:44.320
You know about my missing past?

00:18:55.240 --> 00:18:58.840
This is an ancient Egyptian city.

00:19:09.350 --> 00:19:12.800
That’s me 3,000 years ago.

00:19:13.200 --> 00:19:16.990
Traitor!  You sullied this sacred temple!

00:19:16.990 --> 00:19:18.730
You stay back!

00:19:21.240 --> 00:19:23.920
God is justice.

00:19:23.920 --> 00:19:26.240
God's name is...

00:19:33.340 --> 00:19:36.970
One of the three gods - Obelisk!

00:19:38.700 --> 00:19:41.370
Take this!  God's hammer!

00:19:41.370 --> 00:19:43.560
God Hand Crusher!

00:19:48.680 --> 00:19:50.300
What a battle!

00:19:50.300 --> 00:19:53.740
3,000 years ago in ancient Egypt...

00:19:53.740 --> 00:19:59.310
...they gathered to free Duel Monsters and darkened their souls.

00:19:59.760 --> 00:20:03.840
If people's souls will be darkened again...

00:20:03.840 --> 00:20:12.380
...I must revive the god of Orichalcos and destroy the world, just like I did at Atlantis 10,000 years ago.

00:20:12.380 --> 00:20:15.320
That's what the stars say.

00:20:39.770 --> 00:20:44.520
The Millennium Puzzle showed me this vision of ancient Egypt.

00:20:44.520 --> 00:20:50.190
Those who had darkness in their hearts fought each other and perished.

00:20:50.580 --> 00:20:53.210
We perished?

00:20:53.900 --> 00:20:58.860
But after 3,000 years, something surprising happened.

00:21:02.660 --> 00:21:08.640
Those who had strong souls that could control the dark resurrected.

00:21:08.640 --> 00:21:11.850
Drawn by your cursed soul.

00:21:12.690 --> 00:21:15.120
My cursed soul?

00:21:15.120 --> 00:21:17.660
Why, Nameless Pharaoh?

00:21:17.660 --> 00:21:20.840
Why did you resurrect now?

00:21:21.140 --> 00:21:22.280
Because...

00:21:22.280 --> 00:21:24.360
There's only one answer.

00:21:24.360 --> 00:21:27.890
You'll bring the history of mankind to an end.

00:21:27.890 --> 00:21:30.850
It's your destiny, you cursed Pharaoh!

00:21:30.850 --> 00:21:31.960
What?

00:21:32.580 --> 00:21:37.700
Nameless Pharaoh, dark souls always gather around you.

00:21:37.700 --> 00:21:41.310
You're the source of darkness.

00:21:41.310 --> 00:21:46.260
This 10,000-year history will end with your sacrifice!

00:21:59.510 --> 00:22:08.390
The streets flow by, colored in red

00:22:08.920 --> 00:22:16.760
If you notice your pain, it changes to joy

00:22:18.490 --> 00:22:27.920
People learn of friendship every time they wipe their tears

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:37.410
With the warm strength you gave me, I'll change them into kindness

00:22:38.010 --> 00:22:46.470
My overflowing emotions don't stop

00:22:47.250 --> 00:22:51.980
I'll live feeling them

00:22:52.590 --> 00:22:57.130
For me to be me

00:22:57.130 --> 00:23:05.620
Overflowing friendship heals me

00:23:06.300 --> 00:23:11.260
Our chance meeting was real

00:23:11.780 --> 00:23:20.920
We'll both understand that someday

00:23:27.090 --> 00:23:30.220
With Kaiba's defeat, Yugi fights alone.

00:23:30.220 --> 00:23:33.900
Dartz says Yugi is the cause of the world's destruction.

00:23:33.900 --> 00:23:37.520
Due to emotional pressure and strength difference...

00:23:37.520 --> 00:23:41.640
...Yugi is losing the will to fight.

00:23:41.640 --> 00:23:44.370
Please!  Someone help him!

00:23:44.370 --> 00:23:48.730
Oh yeah!  What about the nameless card Pegasus gave him?

00:23:49.440 --> 00:23:52.700
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Resurrect!
The Three Legendary Knights

00:23:52.700 --> 00:23:54.370
Duel, standby!
